{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#card-zh","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-describe 是一款面向 DSH Web 的视觉输入插件：为不支持图片的纯文本主模型提供图片描述能力。它在图片块位置插入附件标记，并注册 describe_image 工具，让模型按需调用已配置的视觉模型。用户可以引用会话中已有图片，或提供本地图片路径；插件还可自动缩放和压缩大图。适合需要让纯文本模型理解截图、照片或图表的场景。使用前需在专用配置文件中填写视觉模型提供方和型号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:461-515","lib/index.js:565-632"]}
{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#card-en","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-describe lets text-only DSH models work with images. It replaces image blocks with markers and adds a describe_image tool that asks a configured vision model for descriptions. The tool accepts session attachments or local paths and can resize large images.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:461-515","lib/index.js:565-632"]}
