{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#feature-tool","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-describe 的功能「按需描述图片」：模型调用 describe_image 并传入 attachmentId 或本地路径，可选提供提取指令，插件返回视觉模型生成的文字描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:565-632"]}
{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#feature-marker","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-describe 的功能「图片标记替换」：纯文本模型请求包含图片时，插件把图片块换成提示标记，保留 attachmentId 供模型随后调用描述工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:461-515"]}
{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#feature-resize","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-describe 的功能「图片缩放压缩」：发送给视觉模型前可自动将大图缩放并重编码；处理失败时继续使用原图。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/image-resize-core.js:180-269"]}
{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#caveat-config","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用前需在 image-describe.json 中填写 vision.provider 和 vision.model；未配置或配置无效时插件保持休眠，图片描述工具不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:437-453","lib/index.js:614-617"]}
{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-image-describe#caveat-path","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-image-describe","commit":"396c2efc3c8c02c2eece63215365d52c83c02451","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"本地路径输入依赖 DSH 宿主的 fs 与附件服务，并接受 PNG、JPEG、WebP、GIF；图片会按宿主附件上限读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:350-393"]}
